OL,3,GNEWSARoad may close all week after
OL,4,Awater main burst
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road is expected to be closed until
OL,7,Fnext week after a large water main
OL,8,Fburst.
OL,10,FIt happened on the A689 at
OL,11,FHowden-le-Wear, near the Gulf petrol
OL,12,Fstation, on Wednesday night,
OL,13,FNorthumbrian Water said.
OL,15,FThe water firm said its team had
OL,16,Fquickly isolated the issue so that
OL,17,Fresidents' water supplies were not
OL,18,Faffected. Repairs on the pipe were
OL,19,Fstill taking place and the A689 between
OL,20,FBridgefield Court and Park Terrace is
OL,21,Fexpected to be shut for at least the
OL,22,Frest of the week.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
